This is a convenience "native" source package that orchestrates building the
Podman stack from upstream Git repositories during the package build.
Network access is therefore required while building.

To build:
  sudo apt build-dep ./
  PODMAN_VERSION=v5.7.0 dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b

Resulting binary package installs files into /opt/podman-${PODMAN_VERSION}
and configures system integration in maintainer scripts.
